# Swift tests

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-swift-test/SKILL.md`.

- Files live in `macos/ProvenenciaTests/`, not next to app sources. Swift Testing (`@Test`, `#expect`), `@testable import Provenencia`.
- Inject `FakeStore` and temp `OnboardingFolders`. No `GoStore`, dylib, or generated protobuf tests.
- `@MainActor` when exercising `OnboardingModel`. Wire new files into the ProvenenciaTests target in `project.pbxproj` only.

```swift
@Test func loadWithNoIdentityShowsChooseFileUnlocked() async throws {
    let (model, _, _) = try harness()
    await model.load()
    #expect(model.phase == .chooseFile)
    #expect(!model.researcherLocked)
}
```
